msgid ""
"Show only the photos whose name matches. Plain text matches anywhere in "
"the name, and *, ? and [] are wildcards, so *_edit.jpg works. This "
"changes what the list shows, not what a run processes: a hidden photo "
"that is checked is still generated and saved."
msgstr ""
"Mostra apenas as fotos cujo nome corresponde. Texto simples corresponde a"
" qualquer parte do nome, e *, ? e [] são curingas, então *_edit.jpg "
